<p>How does the affected subject reacts to the video throughout it? The description says only the subject orgasms at the end, but the sample occurrences imply unconsciousness and something else far before the end.</p>
<p>Why isn't there some tests to show what happens to subjects during the video? And why they didn't try to contain the entity instead of harming it?</p>
<p>In particular for the later paragraph describing it as just acquired and the shooting as accidental, unavoidable or done by a third party would help to reconcile the story with the idea of it being at Foundation custody now.</p>
